003cbr\u003eIn the kitchen, combine more than 100 ingredients to prepare fun recipes and discover new combinations.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEXPLORE THE INTERACTIVE CITY\u003cbr\u003eDiscover a growing city with different locations to explore and create stories.\u003cbr\u003eVisit Ribbon’s Club, a glamorous nightclub with dance floor, DJ booth, lights and VIP area. Enjoy the park, an outdoor space where you can host parties, fish in the lake, use the slide or relax at the food truck.\u003cbr\u003eThe city also includes an interactive supermarket, where kids can walk through aisles, pick products and play in different sections such as fruits, drinks, frozen food, bakery and sweets.\u003cbr\u003eInside the supermarket, you can prepare fruit juices, make cotton candy or interact with many elements. It also includes storage areas, product management and a delivery system to send groceries to any house in the city.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSANRIO CHARACTERS\u003cbr\u003ePlay with 9 iconic Sanrio characters: Hello Kitty, My Melody, Cinnamoroll, Kuromi, Pompompurin, Pochacco, Tuxedosam, Keroppi and Badtz-Maru.\u003cbr\u003eChange their expressions, make them move, dance and interact. Create unique stories and choose outfits for every occasion.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePETS AND ANIMALS\u003cbr\u003eWith the Puppies and Kitties pack, add 8 dogs and 4 cats to your city. Each pet has its own house, bed, food, toys and accessories.\u003cbr\u003eTake care of them, play and bring them anywhere in the city.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCLOTHING AND CUSTOMIZATION\u003cbr\u003eCustomize characters and pets with outfit packs:\u003cbr\u003e- Love – Valentine outfits\u003cbr\u003e- Glam Night – party looks for the club\u003cbr\u003e- Mystery Pack – 1930s vintage style\u003cbr\u003e- Urban – casual daily outfits\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMINI-GAMES FOR KIDS\u003cbr\u003eEnjoy 27 mini-games where you can run, jump, solve puzzles, collect items and complete fun challenges.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFEATURES\u003cbr\u003e- Open world kids game with interactive city\u003cbr\u003e- 9 Sanrio characters unlocked from the start\u003cbr\u003e- Fully customizable houses\u003cbr\u003e- 500+ interactive objects\u003cbr\u003e- 27 mini-games\u003cbr\u003e- Interactive supermarket role-play\u003cbr\u003e- Pets with animations and care system\u003cbr\u003e- Club, park and multiple locations\u003cbr\u003e- Frequent updates with new content\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA no-rules, no-time-limit game where children can play freely, create stories and explore a growing city with new locations and content.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCOPYRIGHTS:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSANRIO LICENSE\u003cbr\u003eUSED UNDER LICENSE.\u003cbr\u003eSANRIO GMBH\u003cbr\u003e© 2025 SANRIO CO., LTD\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDeveloped by Tap Tap Tales S.L. All Rights Reserved.\u003cbr\u003e© 2025 TAP TAP TALES S.L."],"TapTapTales","1,000,000+",null,"Ages up to 12",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MU2zA42z6OnIu1oGZlGqaoIWDnHErdY_4eXu0FAoYtFxQTXK7t0p5MbH64J7K7vhA9Fytb5xSpZ6-m_Di91Bsg"],null,[185,221,244,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,null,[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,[null,"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language."],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store