cs, and creative tools. Whether coding with Hulk, watching thrilling episodes of Spidey and His Amazing Friends, reading Marvel stories, or revealing and encouraging artistic talents. Kids can even take care of, play with, and nurture their very own Groot. There\u0026#39;s always something new to discover.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUNLOCK A WORLD OF LEARNING with Marvel HQ:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRace with Spidey and His Amazing Friends, tackle coding challenges with Hulk, and navigate asteroid fields with Rocket and Groot to enhance PROBLEM-SOLVING and CRITICAL THINKING skills.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExplore fascinating facts about your favorite heroes and villains, sharpening your child\u0026#39;s COGNITION, KNOWLEDGE and MEMORY.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDive into digital comics and learn-to-read Super Hero stories with actor support, boosting literacy and promoting independent READING.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEncourage creativity by coloring Marvel characters and mastering drawing skills with our powerful tools and instructional videos, fostering ARTISTIC DEVELOPMENT and self-expression.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFEATURES \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• Safe and age-appropriate \u003cbr\u003e• Designed responsibly to let your child enjoy screen time while developing healthy digital habits at a young age \u003cbr\u003e• FTC Approved COPPA Safe Harbor Certification by Privo.\u003cbr\u003e• Play pre-downloaded content offline without wifi or internet \u003cbr\u003e• Regular updates with new content \u003cbr\u003e• No third-party advertising \u003cbr\u003e• No in-app purchases for subscribers\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAnd now, bring Marvel fun with you wherever you go with the brand-new Marvel HQ by StoryToys for Wear OS! Try the brand-new Groove with Groot totally free watch experience. Be Groot’s personal DJ by creating and mixing your own unique tunes. Click on the Groot tile to get Groot dancing and the room bopping with Groot’s unique dance challen