ous fashion pieces you can color and style \u003cbr\u003e• Explore themed scenes and place your creations in stunning settings \u003cbr\u003e• Use art tools like brushes, spray paint, and makeup to bring your designs to life \u003cbr\u003e• Have fun with activities like preparing delicious food and creating colorful bath bombs \u003cbr\u003e• Build creativity, imagination, and self-expression \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTHEMES \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePets, Astronaut, Chef, Fashion Designer, Hair Stylist, Health Care Worker, Makeup Artist, Pop Star, Teacher, Vet, Video Game Programmer, Fashion, Mermaids, Unicorns, Music, Gymnastics, Ice Skating, Soccer, Self-Care, Halloween, Holidays, and More! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAWARDS AND ACCOLADES\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e★ Apps that celebrate inclusion and belonging – National Black Child Development Institute (NBCDI)\u003cbr\u003e★ Kidscreen 2025 Nominee for Best Game App – Branded\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFEATURES \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• Safe and age-appropriate \u003cbr\u003e• Designed responsibly to let your child enjoy screen time while developing healthy digital habits at a young age \u003cbr\u003e• Play pre-downloaded content offline without wifi or internet \u003cbr\u003e• Regular updates with new content \u003cbr\u003e• No third-party advertising \u003cbr\u003e• No in-app purchases for subscribers\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTry the amazing new Barbie™ Color Creations watch experience for Wear OS. Click on the Barbie tile to discover a new coloring project every week! \u003cbr\u003eIf you can dream it, you can create it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSUPPORT \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFor any questions or assistance, please reach out to us at support@storytoys.com\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eABOUT STORYTOYS \u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eOur mission is to bring the world\u0026#39;s most popular characters, worlds, and stories to life for children. We make apps for kids that engage them in well-rounded activities designed to help them learn, play, and grow. Parents can enjoy peace of mind knowing their kids are learning and having fun at the same time.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePRIVACY \u0026amp; TERMS \u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eStoryToys takes children\u0026#39;s privacy seriously and ensures that its apps comply with privacy laws, including the Child Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA). If you would like to learn more about the information we collect and how we use it, please visit our privacy policy at https://storytoys.com/privacy. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRead our terms of use here: https://storytoys.com/terms.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSUBSCRIPTION DETAILS\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis app contains sample content that is free to play. However, LOTS MORE fun and entertaining games and activities are available if you purchase a monthly or yearly subscription. While you are subscribed you can play with EVERYTHING. We regularly add new stuff, so subscribed users will enjoy ever-expanding play opportunities.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGoogle Play does not permit in-app purchases and free apps to be shared via Family Library. Therefore, any purchases you make in this app will NOT be shareable via Family Library.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e©2026 Mattel"],"StoryToys","10,000,000+",null,"Ages up to 8",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qFAHA35-81YOHuAV8PARCXlS47lJ512UraPlUUnliIO1bw6LW0feIdgJvwtSjIjpfaHPv2qlOeh6JcyeJwiLfA"],null,[240,210,253,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,[null,"In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpc