ds, launched in 2014 on PBS KIDS. Each season of the popular ODD SQUAD series features kid agents who use math to investigate strange occurrences, with episodes infused with comedy and fun. A new season premieres in October 2024 and is an official treaty co-production between SSE and BBC Studios Kids \u0026amp; Family in association with CBBC, PBS KIDS, TVOKids, and SRC. Fred Rogers Productions will distribute the series in the U.S., and SSE will take worldwide rights.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePRIVACY\u003cbr\u003eAcross all media platforms, PBS KIDS is committed to creating a safe and secure environment for children and families and being transparent about what information is collected from users. To learn more about PBS KIDS’ privacy policy, visit pbskids.org/privacy."],"PBS KIDS","500+",null,"Ages 6-12",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CLv6W7I6lAWzHo4FZn9Wprfa6fxzZOGia97hK3xQs08-eD3DQkELrO7L--qYs8rzxs1fJwmx2J5B9h3WZADBew"],null,[227,41,106,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],null,null,[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,[null,"Content is generally suitable for all ages. May contain minimal cartoon, fantasy or mild violence and/or infrequent use of mild language."],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dorg.pbskids.oddsquadsealwatchface\u0026rdid\u003dorg.pbskids.oddsquadsealwatchface\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u0