3cbr\u003e🏥 HOSPITAL\u003cbr\u003eStep into the hospital and explore a buzzing city center of doctors, nurses, and patients in this interactive city life game. From x-rays to playful treatments, every tool and room is interactive. Kids can role-play as a doctor, nurse, or avatar patient, turning every visit to the Hospital into new stories across the Pepi City world.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e👶 BABY HOSPITAL\u003cbr\u003eThe Baby Hospital is full of newborns, caring parents, and sweet adventures, making it one of the most loved places in the Pepi City world. Feed, weigh, and comfort every baby while inventing heartwarming city life stories. Dress baby avatars in blankets, use real tools, and discover what it means to be a caring doctor in Pepi’s world. It’s the coziest spot in Pepi City, perfect for kids to explore empathy, joy, and create their own stories in this fun kids game. Every baby avatar becomes part of the city life adventures!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🛒 BABY SHOP\u003cbr\u003eVisit the Baby Shop, a playful area of the city filled with clothes, toys, and surprises. Mix and match to create fresh outfits for your avatars or turn shopping into a fashion show. Try new accessories, style your baby avatars, and make every shopping trip an unforgettable city life moment. In this kids game, every choice sparks creativity and adds fun twists to your avatar life stories.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🏠 HOUSE\u003cbr\u003eEveryday life becomes extraordinary in the House. Cook delicious meals, throw parties, decorate rooms, or just chill with friends, pets, and babies. Each corner is fully interactive and perfect for kids to reimagine routines or invent completely new stories. In Pepi City, even simple family tasks—like feeding a baby or calling a doctor—turn into exciting city role-play that makes this city life game unforgettable.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🎭 CREATE AVATARS\u003cbr\u003eYour world, your rules, your avatars! Use the avatar editor to create families, neighbors, squads, or even baby characters. With endless outfits and styles, every avatar is ready to shine in your unique avatar life story. Build a cast of doctors, parents, and friends who bring Pepi City to life with personality and humor. This is where kids can freely create stories and experiment in a safe, colorful world.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e✨ YOUR CITY, YOUR STORY\u003cbr\u003ePepi City is more than just a game—it’s a living world where imagination drives every moment. Maybe today you’re running the hospital as a busy doctor, tomorrow you’re shopping for baby clothes, and the next day you’re hosting the wildest house party. With colorful avatars, hundreds of items, and limitless freedom to create, every play session in this city life adventure feels brand new. For every kids game fan, it’s the perfect way to explore, play, and invent endless stories. Pepi City is your world—create city life adventures with avatars any way you imagine.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eJump in, explore, and start your journey—your Pepi City avatar life begins now!"],"Pepi Play","100,000,000+",null,"Ages up to 12",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/d9W3Wz7g1DEvy1Amp8cIhojC5x7XGs-S4mcPwA2nWI3GO9m3QdsAltHx5tn8xqIlEBsBgoeRydz4oKiWFmtrPA"],null,[121,213,237,255]],null,["Everyone",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IciOnDFecb5Xt50Q2jlcNC0LPI7LEGxNojroo-s3AozcyS-vDCwtq4fn7u3wZmRna8OewG9PBrWC-i7i"]],[null,"Crude Humor"],[null,"In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],0,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OBVqgRK7eerY0GPfK8AOzitu5oE9ecC6kG4kURTCb1K41gpqVsN0WjmJwJh-wX8vILzpcc1kYHt56aLN2g"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"USD",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,nu